# The Brugaire Consortium (sandoria 12): Fontoumant, Regine, Apstaule and Thierride in Port San d'Oria; the deliveries.
# Available: 100 gil to Fontoumant (no trade handler: nothing); 509 with option 1 (nothing: option 0 accepts); 509 with
# option 0 (the Parcel for the Magic Shop, begun). Prog 0 / Option 0: his 560; 99 gil (fewer than 100: nil); 101 gil
# (not exactly 100: nil); a chip to Regine (nil; her script: Flyers for Regine not accepted, nothing); the parcel and a
# chip (not exactly the parcel: nil); the parcel (535: taken, Prog 1); 100 gil at Prog 1 / Option 0 (Prog != Option:
# nil); his 511 (the Parcel for the Auction House, Option 1); his 560; the parcel and a chip to Apstaule (nil), the
# parcel (540: Prog 2); his 512 (the Parcel for the Pub, Option 2); the parcel and a chip to Thierride (nil: A Taste for
# Meat's 529 or his script's 529), the parcel (539: Prog 3); his 515 (completed: Lauan Shield, fame +20, Courier
# Extraordinaire); then his default 561, and 100 gil (nothing). The paid deliveries (608-610) and each parcel at the
# wrong Prog are #gil; Prog 3 = Option 3 (the Prog < 3 operand) is #prog3.
# Fontoumant and Apstaule have no script (defaults 561, 542). Regine's script always starts 510 on a talk (not used
# here) and takes 10 gil for Flyers for Regine (not accepted). Thierride's script starts 529 on any trade; A Taste for
# Meat (available, Prog 0) answers his trades with 529 too; 539 (Progress) wins over both. Riding on the Clouds (LB4) and
# Her Memories name Fontoumant and Thierride but are closed to a WAR 10.
lists PortSanDoria/Fontoumant/onTrigger PortSanDoria/Fontoumant/onTrade PortSanDoria/Regine/onTrade PortSanDoria/Apstaule/onTrade PortSanDoria/Thierride/onTrade PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/509 PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/511 PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/512 PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/515 PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/535 PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/539 PortSanDoria/onEventFinish/540
char zone=PortSanDoria pos=-9.133,-8,-122.199 job=WAR lvl=10 gil=1000
item BoneChip
login
trade Fontoumant gil=100                  # available: no trade handler, no script: nothing
trigger Fontoumant                        # 509
finish option=1                           # option 1: nothing
trigger Fontoumant                        # 509
finish                                    # option 0: the Parcel for the Magic Shop; begun
trigger Fontoumant                        # Prog 0 = Option 0: 560 (Event)
finish
trade Fontoumant gil=99                   # fewer than 100 gil: nil
trade Fontoumant gil=101                  # not exactly 100 gil: nil
walk 69.801,-8.102,-73.724
trade Regine BoneChip x1                  # Prog 0, not the parcel: nil; her script: nothing
trade Regine ParcelForTheMagicShop x1 BoneChip x1   # Prog 0, not exactly the parcel: nil
trade Regine ParcelForTheMagicShop x1     # Prog 0, exactly the parcel: 535
finish                                    # the parcel taken; Prog 1
walk -9.133,-8,-122.199
trade Fontoumant gil=100                  # Prog 1, Option 0 (not equal): nil
trigger Fontoumant                        # Prog 1 > Option 0: 511
finish                                    # the Parcel for the Auction House; Option 1
trigger Fontoumant                        # Prog 1 = Option 1: 560
finish
walk -5.483,-13.3,-157.517
trade Apstaule ParcelForTheAuctionHouse x1 BoneChip x1   # Prog 1, not exactly the parcel: nil (no script)
trade Apstaule ParcelForTheAuctionHouse x1   # Prog 1: 540
finish                                    # the parcel taken; Prog 2
trigger Fontoumant                        # Prog 2 > Option 1: 512
finish                                    # the Parcel for the Pub; Option 2
walk -65.949,-5.496,-28.792
trade Thierride ParcelForThePub x1 BoneChip x1   # Prog 2, not exactly the parcel: nil; A Taste for Meat's / his script's 529
finish
trade Thierride ParcelForThePub x1        # Prog 2: 539
finish                                    # the parcel taken; Prog 3
trigger Fontoumant                        # Prog 3 > Option 2: 515
finish                                    # completed: Lauan Shield, fame +20, Courier Extraordinaire
trigger Fontoumant                        # completed: no section; his default 561
finish
trade Fontoumant gil=100                  # completed: no trade handler: nothing
